The DynHost records are updated through the DynHost endpoint of OVHcloud
(https://docs.ovhcloud.com/fr/guides/web-cloud/domains/dns-dynhost), with the
DynHost identifier each user creates in the OVHcloud Control Panel. The public
address of the home is read on the public echo services ipify
(https://www.ipify.org), icanhazip (https://icanhazip.com) and ident.me
(https://ident.me), which only see the address a request comes from.

